  "solution": {
    "text": "when <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are perpendicular and velocity has no change then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> The two forces oppose each other so, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math> is along <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />As <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are perpendicular to each other<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
